{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Seed lexemes (controller §8: 12–20). Sixteen words chosen so that the set closes",
    "over the ten seed kanji: every headword decomposes into seed kanji only, and every",
    "seed kanji is used by at least one headword. test/dataset.test.ts asserts both",
    "directions, so the seed cannot quietly grow a word whose kanji page does not exist.",
    "reading/partOfSpeech/senses are REAL JMdict entries and each carries that entry's real",
    "ent_seq in source_entry_id. They are not hand-assembled any more; D-1 is closed for",
    "content, with the licence chain recorded in LICENSES.md §2. Regenerate or re-verify",
    "with: node packages/seed/scripts/fetch-edrdg.mjs [--check]",
    "headword and kanjiUsed stay project-owned: which words the seed covers is a selection,",
    "not a lexicographic claim, and kanjiUsed is recomputed from the headword by the tests."
  ],
